From 1105d4a47faadb957e43e945837e1b7c879b0e4f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sirio Balmelli <sirio@b-ad.ch>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 07:44:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] client: isolate macOS DNS state per interface

Prevent multiple macOS clients from sharing scutil DNS keys.
Prevent one instance from changing another instance's DNS configuration.
Include the WireGuard interface in each key.
Preserve shutdown-state compatibility across upgrades and rollbacks.
Keep legacy migration separate from interface-scoped recovery.

Fixes: https://github.com/netbirdio/netbird/issues/446

Assisted-by: OpenCode:openai/gpt-5.6-sol-fast
Signed-off-by: Sirio Balmelli <sirio@b-ad.ch>
